ributional Equilibrium and Long Half-Life. <i>Drug design, development and therapy 14:811–821</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.2147/DDDT.S236701\">10.2147/DDDT.S236701</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32158198\">32158198</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Choi_2020: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
